# LongRoad.Packages

- Assembly for local/third-party scripts under `Assets/Packages` (not UPM `Packages/`).
- Must **not** reference `LongRoad`, `LongRoad.Core`, or `LongRoad.Domain`.
- Keep vendor code isolated; game layers may reference this assembly.
- Prefer upstream-friendly structure so updates do not entangle with game namespaces.
